+        0x0590..=0x08FF
+        | 0xFB1D..=0xFDFF
+        | 0xFE70..=0xFEFF
+        | 0x10800..=0x10FFF
+        | 0x1E800..=0x1EFFF
+        | 0x200F
+        | 0x202B
+        | 0x202E
+        | 0x2067)
